{"data": [{"author_id": "793853199975272448", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:09:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120141852020244703"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Jasuki__Hope/s…", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Jasuki__Hope/status/2108932130235699495", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/XQRUMHgxSY"}]}, "id": "2120141852020244703", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1356, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108932130235699495", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "台湾2026年10月出生人口暴跌15.0％ \n2026年10月台湾出生人口只有8035人，死亡人口17393人。其中出生人口相比去年同期减少15.0％，相比前年同期减少33.4％，已经连续19个月不足1万人 \n台湾继续超自我灭绝的道路狂奔，沾了进步主义经济再好也没用 https://t.co/XQRUMHgxSY", "url": "https://x.com/Jasuki__Hope/status/2120141852020244703"}, {"author_id": "805955973827338240", "created_at": "2026-11-09T07:35:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119695377347821781"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 5, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 0, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2119695377347821781", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok  中国出生人口性别比是多少", "url": "https://x.com/Rebeccagrey1231/status/2119695377347821781"}, {"author_id": "1670961752459325441", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120141097796284871"], "id": "2120141097796284871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "如果生育率保持目前的水平，美国将在2080年代的某个时候超过中国的年出生人口数量，并在2120年左右超过中国的总人口数量。", "url": "https://x.com/nbdxe/status/2120141097796284871"}, {"author_id": "1454514077586190338", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:38:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119590338323181809"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ichardrv/statu…", "end": 90, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ichardrv/status/2119235957056762159", "start": 67, "url": "https://t.co/rEyajnUUo3"}]}, "id": "2119590338323181809", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119235957056762159", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "小霸王那个网页直接玩FC，不用装模拟器太方便了。还有投胎模拟器结合出生人口数据算下辈子去哪，这脑洞开得有点东西啊，下次摸鱼就靠它了。 https://t.co/rEyajnUUo3", "url": "https://x.com/Sumingbt/status/2119590338323181809"}, {"author_id": "1597775547169382400", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:47:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120060749452362027"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 77, "start": 72, "tag": "升学规划"}, {"end": 83, "start": 78, "tag": "出生人口"}, {"end": 87, "start": 84, "tag": "高考"}, {"end": 91, "start": 88, "tag": "点赞"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/1b1GLbmuds", "end": 122, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ShengHu8964/status/2120060749452362027/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120060746323365888", "start": 99, "url": "https://t.co/1b1GLbmuds"}]}, "id": "2120060749452362027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "是谁成功把孩子生在了升学巅峰？\n2016年出生1786万人，2034年高考最难！\n一张表看清幼升小、中考、高考时间线\n看看你家娃踩在哪个段位？\n#升学规划 #出生人口 #高考\n#点赞+收藏+关注# https://t.co/1b1GLbmuds", "url": "https://x.com/ShengHu8964/status/2120060749452362027"}, {"author_id": "1922243537179136000", "created_at": "2026-11-09T02:14:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119614614405304780"], "id": "2119614614405304780", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "据环球时报援引媒体8日报道，受此前出生人口锐减影响，韩国明年小学入学人数预计将首次跌破30万，距首次跌破40万仅隔3年。与1968年105.56万人的历史峰值相比，明年入学人数可能只有当年的1/4。", "url": "https://x.com/Ordoseducaptain/status/2119614614405304780"}, {"author_id": "1639520962600402950", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:14:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119569382330560870"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/2SbG8JAqxA", "end": 100, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LeeHamli/status/2119569382330560870/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119569364878020608", "start": 77, "url": "https://t.co/2SbG8JAqxA"}]}, "id": "2119569382330560870", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 139, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "1107 红叶简讯 末世乱象\n\n*民政部数据显示：2026年前三季度，全国结婚登记仅有464.8万对。人口学家预测，这意味着2027年的出生人口将暴跌。 https://t.co/2SbG8JAqxA", "url": "https://x.com/LeeHamli/status/2119569382330560870"}, {"author_id": "1535844721649545218", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:13:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119871048313454973"], "id": "2119871048313454973", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 123, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国新增出生人口大幅衰退和登记结婚人口大幅下降全部发生在习近平任期内。\n\n自杀人口数量处于历史高位也是在习近平任期内。\n\n阶级固化、贫富差距扩大、中产返贫、居民家庭资产负债表衰退等等经济数据恶化全部发生在习近平任期内。\n\n这是不争的事实。", "url": "https://x.com/fight7freedom33/status/2119871048313454973"}, {"author_id": "1923698544122396677", "created_at": "2026-11-09T09:32:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119724796665536830"], "id": "2119724796665536830", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "792万新生儿，1870万在岗教师\n师范，天坑专业。？\n我们光县城就有七所小学，今年共招新生约3000多人，去年全县出生人口才1200多人，等去年这1200人上小学时，县有多少小学老师多出来了？\n每年退休五十万左右，不招聘教师，10年退休500万左右。企业正在多数破产，亏损，税收上不来，哪有钱养活这些人啊", "url": "https://x.com/hyi54556/status/2119724796665536830"}, {"author_id": "1886411436907278336", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:02:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119838126751559773"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hxqGgl20tQ", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Andy_NFSC/status/2119838126751559773/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119838107281567744", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/hxqGgl20tQ"}]}, "id": "21198381267515