: "1886411436907278336", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:25:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119843753833980030"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TZYienfWHg", "end": 180, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Andy_NFSC/status/2119843753833980030/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119843734850609152", "start": 157, "url": "https://t.co/TZYienfWHg"}]}, "id": "2119843753833980030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1107 红叶简讯 末世乱象\n\n*民政部数据显示：2026年前三季度，全国结婚登记仅有464.8万对。人口学家预测，这意味着2027年的出生人口将暴跌。\n*11月6日，全国高校首个“冷门绝学学院”在中国社会科学院大学（社科大）正式揭牌成立。网评：失传多年的辟邪剑法、茴字的100种写法，这些冷门绝学终于开始研究了 https://t.co/TZYienfWHg", "url": "https://x.com/Andy_NFSC/status/2119843753833980030"}, {"author_id": "1863852936616628224", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:27:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119602671745462661"], "id": "2119602671745462661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "“养儿防老”，会不会是中国最大的庞氏骗局？\n\n① 2025年，中国60岁以上老人已达3.23亿，全年出生人口却只有792万，老年人口越来越多，年轻人越来越少，谁来为上一代的养老买单？\n\n②", "url": "https://x.com/popoonexu/status/2119602671745462661"}, {"author_id": "1486571626661437440", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:03:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120125197344997506"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NIL9mNWF7e", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2120125197344997506/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120124677096091648", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/NIL9mNWF7e"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Yelvlv930/stat…", "end": 191, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Yelvlv930/status/2118965668741881938", "start": 168, "url": "https://t.co/ymxa9ptCAe"}]}, "id": "2120125197344997506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 4275, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118965668741881938", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "关于人口老龄化，咱们此前分享过建国后的三波婴儿潮，今天着重聊聊第二波：六三婴儿潮。👶🏻\n\n1960年代初，三年困难时期结束后，中国迎来了一大波补偿性生育。1962到1975年，平均每年出生约2600万人。其中1963年接近3000万，是建国以来出生人口最多的一年，因此也被叫六三婴儿潮。 https://t.co/NIL9mNWF7e https://t.co/ymxa9ptCAe", "url": "https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2120125197344997506"}, {"author_id": "2091191689499316224", "created_at": "2026-11-09T07:09:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119688871592198394"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oBHNkD4mxO", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ofrbkj/status/2119688871592198394/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119688861806895104", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/oBHNkD4mxO"}]}, "id": "2119688871592198394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 307, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "越来越悲观了。\n\n中国人口结构正在发生一个很明显的变化：\n\n2025年，每100名劳动年龄人口，要对应23名老人、22名孩子。\n\n这是1982年有可比数据以来，老年抚养比首次超过少儿抚养比。\n\n再看几个数字：\n\n出生人口：792万。\n死亡人口：1131万。\n65岁以上老人：2.24亿。 https://t.co/oBHNkD4mxO", "url": "https://x.com/ofrbkj/status/2119688871592198394"}, {"author_id": "1904711716635893760", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:25:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119753270080229729"], "id": "2119753270080229729", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2555, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "未来20年什么是优质资产？\n\n先问一个问题。\n\n你爸妈那一代人，最成功的投资是什么?", "url": "https://x.com/lichangshengvip/status/2119753270080229729"}, {"author_id": "3429075845", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:26:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119572298399134123"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/rytsu_tabioto/…", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/rytsu_tabioto/status/2119329365389701473", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/LxXNb0YHcW"}]}, "id": "2119572298399134123", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 4029, "like_count": 96, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119329365389701473", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Seems like incredible folly for a country with a TFR of 1.14 to axe the remaining government incentives to have children. While we do know that pro-natal government incentives do not significantly increase fertility rates, we don’t generally know if removing long-standing https://t.co/LxXNb0YHcW", "url": "https://x.com/FedPoasting/status/2119572298399134123"}, {"author_id": "2080900856090886144", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119958222559912204"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rGfq9YMXLd", "end": 124, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ZhaiTalk/status/2119958222559912204/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119722082640822273", "start": 101, "url": "https://t.co/rGfq9YMXLd"}]}, "id": "2119958222559912204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 10713, "like_count": 69, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "中国经济已经无药可救？六大结构性危机全面爆发，习近平再怎么撒钱也没用！\n\n中国经济为什么越救越糟？为什么中共不断发钱、化债、发行国债、推出平准基金，投入巨额资金刺激经济，却始终无法扭转经济下行的趋势？ https://t.co/rGfq9YMXLd", "url": "https://x.com/ZhaiTalk/status/2119958222559912204"}, {"author_id": "1674860256562667520", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:42:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119953723082543168"], "id": "2119953723082543168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I just went ahead and saw the fertility reports of every single country.\nWhite populations plus Japan have increased slightly \n\nTop three countries with the lowest TFR :\n1.) North Korea- 0.4\n2.) South Korea- 0.7\n3. Macau- 0.7", "url": "https://x.com/KaliKrause968/status/2119953723082543168"}, {"author_id": "1473474580970934274", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:42:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119787654459822450"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/hedgeye/status…", "end": 206, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/hedgeye/status/2119023808749466098", "start": 183, "url": "https://t.co/fFKlUBNWEG"}]}, "id": "2119787654459822450", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119023808749466098", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Wow this chart actually proves immigration saved America’s fertility rate after the 70’s. Reagan’s Mass Amnesty came in ‘86 and right after look at 1990 climbing back up to 2.07 TFR. https://t.co/fFKlUBNWEG", "url": "https://x.com/DrkNite_23/status/2119787654459822450"}, {"author_id": "1803012493255598080", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:51:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120227932492681429"], "id": "2120227932492681429", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What if we could fix the birth rate in America?\nBottom line: Adding the current abortion volume to live births would raise annual U.S. births from ~3.61 million to ~4.74 million and lift the general fertility rate from the low-50s to around 70 per 1,000 women 15–44 (and the TFR", "url": "https://x.com/Pb3377_/status/2120227932492681429"}, {"author_id": "1853173172327120896", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:25:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120206233059885497"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/halalboozee/st…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/halalboozee/status/2119894504530698253", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/vO82vQUGES"}]}, "id": "2120206233059885497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119894504530698253", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Once women used to be the flagbearer of fertility, they loved and wanted kids after kids so that the civiliza